    "title": "Magnolia officials warn residents of street construction to take place over the next few days - NewsBreak",
    "text": "MAGNOLIA, Ark. (KTVE/KARD) — Beginning on Thursday, June 19, 2025, at the Magnolia Fire Station (corner of Pine Street), construction work will start and will continue toward Vine Street. Courtesy photo of City of Magnolia Also, work will take place on Washington Street, as well as Jefferson and Madison Streets heading north. Magnolia officials appreciate everyone’s patience and support while work is being done. For more information, contact Magnolia city officials at (870) 234-1375. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to KTVE - myarklamiss.com.",
